WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.583 --> 00:00:01.458
Leave me alone!

00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:03.583
All I said was we should bail on the hike!

00:00:03.667 --> 00:00:06.125
I didn’t mean us in general. I just meant the hike!

00:00:06.208 --> 00:00:07.875
You don’t want to make our relationship better?

00:00:07.917 --> 00:00:09.583
Our relationship is fine!

00:00:10.333 --> 00:00:11.125
What’s that?

00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:12.083
Church bells?

00:00:13.667 --> 00:00:14.583
Schmigadoon?

00:00:15.875 --> 00:00:18.250
Welcome to our little town!

00:00:18.333 --> 00:00:21.000
Where friends are all you meet.

00:00:21.083 --> 00:00:22.458
It must be something they do for tourists.

00:00:22.542 --> 00:00:23.417
Hey everyone!

00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:24.750
Hey there Pete!

00:00:25.959 --> 00:00:26.875
Can we go now?

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:27.667
Already?

00:00:29.458 --> 00:00:30.125
What?

00:00:31.583 --> 00:00:36.458
We can’t leave. It’s like magic. We’re in an actual musical.

00:00:36.542 --> 00:00:37.291
Please god no.

00:00:37.375 --> 00:00:38.583
Everybody!

00:00:43.834 --> 00:00:48.667
They said we’re only here ‘til we found true love. Do you think this is true love?

00:00:48.750 --> 00:00:52.041
What does that even mean? Who knows what Schmigadoon thinks is true love?

00:00:52.125 --> 00:00:54.166
Which of you ladies wants to cross this bridge with me?

00:00:54.917 --> 00:00:56.709
You want to try with other people?

00:00:57.542 --> 00:00:59.208
What a beautiful couple you two make.

00:00:59.291 --> 00:01:03.125
Stop it, you are stunning. Compared to you, I’m a barefoot mess.

00:01:03.166 --> 00:01:03.667
AH!

00:01:03.750 --> 00:01:05.417
Let’s just go find your shoes, shall we?

00:01:15.834 --> 00:01:16.917
We’re stuck here forever.

00:01:17.000 --> 00:01:17.959
You’re just going to give up?

00:01:18.041 --> 00:01:21.291
We’re smart. We found our way out of Ikea. We’ll find a way out of here.

00:01:21.333 --> 00:01:22.875
Ladies, can I get a cackle?

00:01:34.375 --> 00:01:36.625
We’re in a musical okay? Nobody gets killed in a musical.

00:01:37.208 --> 00:01:38.125
Except Oklahoma.

00:01:38.208 --> 00:01:42.125
And Carousel, and South Pacific. Oh, hello, West Side Story!

00:01:42.166 --> 00:01:43.500
That’s all the musicals!

